  "prefLabel": "We 101.39 Shale packer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 101.39 “Shale packer” means a flexible rubber-like cone collar designed to fit between a well casing and a larger diameter hole and designed to prevent material placed above it from passing by it and into the well below.\n\nSource. #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08 (from We 101.32); renumbered by #12075 (formerly We 101.34)",
